01D44KSY9Z","text":"deepinに依存してるんじゃないですかね、この場合\nなので逆引きかと思ったんですが","ts":"1619929235.140400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"PXx"}]},{"client_msg_id":"b95f8dfc-2c7f-494c-b52f-2bf59ad566c9","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"普通にdeepinのパッケージから reverse無しのpactree実行する方が楽な気がする","ts":"1619929215.139900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"uayq"}]},{"client_msg_id":"920940d1-6e0b-40a5-9fc2-2d7ec5db1fe2","type":"message","user":"U01D44KSY9Z","text":"`pactree -r \u0026lt;package\u0026gt;` でそのパッケージに依存してるパッケージ追えそう","ts":"1619929185.139400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"ZdF9i"}]},{"client_msg_id":"cfe18a00-226d-42a4-966a-48bbd5fbdf5c","type":"message","user":"U01D44KSY9Z","text":"pactreeって被依存のパッケージも追えるのかな","ts":"1619929079.138800","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"eyes","count":1,"users":["U7B4ZD49X"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"ydX"}]},{"client_msg_id":"4bc9b3d9-afc0-402b-8626-17b3eb8415c7","type":"message","user":"U01D44KSY9Z","text":"今やってみましたけどないですね\n何かの依存っぽい気はする","ts":"1619929014.137900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"SC5w"}]},{"client_msg_id":"b63e0ee3-068a-4d05-8f70-74ebe62cd785","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"ちなみにdeepinは割と好き、使わないけど","ts":"1619929010.137800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"5nS+"}]},{"client_msg_id":"c0a3e5d3-2169-4dd5-9453-63b684e0bb9a","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"何かの依存？","ts":"1619928982.137200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"drL"}]},{"client_msg_id":"ad3b96f0-9dae-45a2-aab6-290b48b45cb0","t